{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, חַי","hw":"חַי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חַי</span></big>  <strong>adj. living (</strong>BH id.<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  of God: cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:31\" href=\"/Daniel.4.31\">Dn 4:31</a>, emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:21\" href=\"/Daniel.6.21\">6:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:27\" href=\"/Daniel.6.27\">27</a>; men, pl. emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיַּיָּא</span> <em>the living</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:30\" href=\"/Daniel.2.30\">2:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:14\" href=\"/Daniel.4.14\">4:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(חַי עָֽלְמָא)</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  pl. as n. abstr. <em>life</em> <strong>(</strong>BH <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיִּים</span><strong>)</strong>: <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיִּין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:12\" href=\"/Daniel.7.12\">7:12</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיֵּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:10\" href=\"/Ezra.6.10\">Ezr 6:10</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, חֵיוָא","prev":"BDB Aramaic, חֲיָא"}